    "name": "Old King Charcoal Soap Bar- Cedarwood and Fir",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;Our soap is carefully crafted using a blend of saponified coconut, palm, olive, canola, &amp; castor oils, and rain water ensuring a gentle and nourishing cleansing experience, and promoting sustainability and purity. Infused with essential oils, our soaps offer a delightful and aromatic sensation. Free from harsh chemicals, our natural soap is a gentle choice for both your skin and the environment. Crafted with love and care.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Other ingredients for fragrance, texture &amp; color include: ground coffee, poppy seeds, Brazilian clays, kaolin clay, ginger, calendula, charcoal, or honey &amp; beeswax.&nbsp; One or more of the following essential oils: lemongrass, rosemary, peppermint, lavender, cedar wood, fir, honeysuckle, or tuberose.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">We only use biodegradable shrink wrap on our soaps.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Biolefin is formulated to be totally degradable in the environment. At the end of its useful life, it fragments and oxidizes by the effect of light and heat. It then becomes assimilable by s o i l m i c r o - o r g a n i s m s , a n d eventually disappears, leaving only water, carbon dioxide and biomass.</span></p>",
